<header class="page-head"><p class="eyebrow">REFERENCE LIBRARIES</p><h1>Deutsche Grammatik · A1 bis B1</h1><p class="dek">A searchable starting index linked to the course curriculum. Entries are expanded alongside the lessons that teach them.</p></header>
<label class="search-label" for="reference-search">Search grammar topics, verbs, vocabulary and expressions</label><input id="reference-search" type="search" placeholder="Try: Akkusativ, werden, Bewerbung…"><div class="reference-grid" id="reference-results">
{% for chapter in chapters %}<section class="reference-card" data-search="{{ chapter.grammar }} {{ chapter.title }}"><h2>{{ chapter.title }}</h2><p class="eyebrow">{{ chapter.level }}</p><p>{{ chapter.grammar }}</p><ul>{% for lesson in chapter.lessons %}<li>{% if lesson.id == "L01" or lesson.id == "L02" or lesson.id == "L03" or lesson.id == "L27" %}<a href="{{ ('/lessons/' + lesson.id + '/') | url }}">{{ lesson.id }} · {{ lesson.title }}</a>{% else %}{{ lesson.id }} · {{ lesson.title }}{% endif %}</li>{% endfor %}</ul></section>{% endfor %}</div>
<section><h2>Current verified entries</h2><p>The vocabulary and verb examples taught in L01 and L27 are embedded in the lessons. Full searchable verb atlas, thematic vocabulary library, expressions handbook and comprehensive grammar articles remain to be authored. No coverage count is inferred from the curriculum index.</p></section>
